8d515cee21c7c0adc1c87f2cf56", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/eccf78c9/uploads/origins/20b1ffa6-3dbb-4ac9-8537-810c0f1b3fbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f93238d515cee21c7c0adc1c87f2cf56, https://si.imgix.net/eccf78c9/uploads/origins/20b1ffa6-3dbb-4ac9-8537-810c0f1b3fbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7578dcdc7cd7fa13be2017e27fb796ce 2x, https://si.imgix.net/eccf78c9/uploads/origins/20b1ffa6-3dbb-4ac9-8537-810c0f1b3fbf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a6339df04b59717e2faf0889f10b82fc 3x"}, "body": "ごきげんよう。\n\nあなたの作品にとても驚いています!是非とも依頼したいです!16:9の比率で、背景を透明にして、アニメーションをループさせたいと思います!この作品を使い、twitch, youtube, twitter, discordであなたの名前をクレジットします!\n\nポーズや表情は自由にやってください♡ かわいいものだとカラフルでいいと思います。VTuberの自分は、アンビバレントで甘えん坊です。ゲームをよくするのと、特に星座（月とか星とか）が大好きです！（笑）。できればサムネイルとして透明バージョンもあると嬉しいです!リクエストに応えてくださるととても嬉しいです♡。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Wje3Oqax1bRPmvsUSYrVUXBw1sVVrB28", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ozyo_hoka/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 358331, "client_id": 2085106, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9c92151b/uploads/origins/10971b24-61c7-41e2-a377-884c86036046?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c88acb365ad734fc733904a6bd165cce", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9c92151b/uploads/origins/10971b24-61c7-41e2-a377-884c86036046?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c88acb365ad734fc733904a6bd165cce, https://si.imgix.net/9c92151b/uploads/origins/10971b24-61c7-41e2-a377-884c86036046?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec6e18474b5270f3d14bfa7cc80b3a97 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9c92151b/uploads/origins/10971b24-61c7-41e2-a377-884c86036046?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6a462977edb9b5bfdb9c647ec6c0279a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9c92151b/uploads/origins/10971b24-61c7-41e2-a377-884c86036046?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8a31aaffc0ed4bcb49f5f80dedeff73b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9c92151b/uploads/origins/10971b24-61c7-41e2-a377-884c86036046?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8a31aaffc0ed4bcb49f5f80dedeff73b, https://si.imgix.net/9c92151b/uploads/origins/10971b24-61c7-41e2-a377-884c86036046?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c45c26d54169a921ee84f47da84c23b7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9c92151b/uploads/origins/10971b24-61c7-41e2-a377-884c86036046?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b50d1b6d9e5e6baf53fc85551d0bb650 3x"}, "body": "はじめまして。\n先生のこの作品(https://skeb.jp/@ozyo_hoka/works/5)がとても華やかで好みだったので依頼させていただきます。\n\nファルリアちゃん(https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Mv-l8lJPvQgQf0tzHXZPN4iaXe11izEO?usp=sharing)を可愛く華やかに描いていただきたいです。\n衣装はこれと同じものなのでこっちの方がわかりやすいかもしれません。(https://booth.pm/ja/items/3817909)\n目の方は音符と蝶が描かれてますが複雑だと思うので難しいなら簡略化していただいてもかまいません。\n\nポーズ、背景等その他はすべておまかせいたします。\n\n希望が多く大変恐縮ですが、よろしくお願いします。", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ozyo_hoka/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 358331, "client_id": 1853456, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/234bd198/uploads/origins/3d388cfa-11d0-41ee-824c-edd91b3c6613?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=df0d5b93efd9d2f9c6da285d100cae2a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/234bd198/uploads/origins/3d388cfa-11d0-41ee-824c-edd91b3c6613?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=df0d5b93efd9d2f9c6da285d100cae2a, https://si.imgix.net/234bd198/uploads/origins/3d388cfa-11d0-41ee-824c-edd91b3c6613?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=904519b3c0e25d5f09a87c729695fa1d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/234bd198/uploads/origins/3d388cfa-11d0-41ee-824c-edd91b3c6613?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b099965127ddece688cd9f9d4de0cad4 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/234bd198/uploads/origins/3d388cfa-11d0-41ee-824c-edd91b3c6613?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ea085eb4ad4dbd9dd2b2ea423db41fe4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/234bd198/uploads/origins/3d388cfa-11d0-41ee-824c-edd91b3c6613?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ea085eb4ad4dbd9dd2b2ea423db41fe4, https://si.imgix.net/234bd198/uploads/origins/3d388cfa-11d0-41ee-824c-edd91b3c6613?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fa690bd0c945a30e0e78fb42bdc27956 2x, https://si.imgix.net/234bd198/uploads/origins/3d388cfa-11d0-41ee-824c-edd91b3c6613?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b57fd22e1990bebc974cf1268909cb91 3x"}, "body": "Heyo!\n\nI really loved the artwork you did for the black and orange office tiger :)\n\nCould I please get a 16:9 ratio artwork with my OC in a lying down pose? I have attached an example. I'd love to have her holding a candy cane in the hand behind her head. Could she also have a winky face with her tongue slightly out? I am not sure what to do with her legs, I don't know whether I prefer them to be up like in the example photo or down. it is up to you :) She is playful and cute.\n\nCan the background be her lying in a glowing crystal cave? I have attached an example. Can the crystals be green though please? Thank you :)\n\nUnfortunately, my Live2D is not yet complete. I have attached a photo of what has been done already, plus the sketch. If you cannot fit the wings in, that is fine. The horns are also slightly whiter/lighter than the Live2D currently has.\n\nI also have a golden ring around my tail which was left out of the sketch. I have attached a picture of that as well. Thank you in advance :)\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1q0O6jQW--cr9ESAV0Ee8vgeV6LeIA_MN?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ozyo_hoka/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 358331, "client_id": 968619, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d4a8674f/uploads/origins/7f5bc044-3e7d-42af-917c-29a0d1dedf0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9053b64fd2875254212f80f56f8498c7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d4a8674f/uploads/origins/7f5bc044-3e7d-42af-917c-29a0d1dedf0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9053b64fd2875254212f80f56f8498c7, https://si.imgix.net/d4a8674f/uploads/origins/7f5bc044-3e7d-42af-917c-29a0d1dedf0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e9bfffdaa2105e18ef6b509d1015576a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d4a8674f/uploads/origins/7f5bc044-3e7d-42af-917c-29a0d1dedf0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e8471d724d7b8c63cf3b99a97480aed6 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d4a8674f/uploads/origins/7f5bc044-3e7d-42af-917c-29a0d1dedf0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=45ba4aabb0654f6f21903a6c4d6d9e46", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d4a8674f/uploads/origins/7f5bc044-3e7d-42af-917c-29a0d1dedf0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=45ba4aabb0654f6f21903a6c4d6d9e46, https://si.imgix.net/d4a8674f/uploads/origins/7f5bc044-3e7d-42af-917c-29a0d1dedf0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1c29a17dadf0c7099204184e6b96ddb5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d4a8674f/uploads/origins/7f5bc044-3e7d-42af-917c-29a0d1dedf0e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=20db2fd3703a6dad430723d90bb29838 3x"}, "body": "Hi! Your art is very cute! Could you draw my vtuber? I’ll leave the pose and background up to you!\nShe's a red panda,,, obsessed with sunflowers and videogames! She has a red panda plushie too!\n\nReferences:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1iZMkvje8GAK07Rz_H-Il06yhxya-4ytx?usp=sharing\n\nI would like to use this picture on Twitch and Twitter. I will of course credit you. Could you possibly make this ratio 16: 9 landscape? Would it be possible to put the background and signature on separate layers or have it as a psd file with different layers? \n\nThank chu very much and plwease stay safe ♥", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ozyo_hoka/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 358331, "client_id": 1851843, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/38e9373b/uploads/origins/516d4302-02c4-4261-9611-d12f2d73fd75?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=483063baf7a9d813e6555400f963597b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/38e9373b/uploads/origins/516d4302-02c4-4261-9611-d12f2d73fd75?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=483063baf7a9d813e6555400f963597b, https://si.imgix.net/38e9373b/uploads/origins/516d4302-02c4-4261-9611-d12f2d73fd75?bg